    "content": "<p>April has been packed with creativity, passion, and incredible community energy across War Robots: Frontiers. From artistic builds and storytelling to gameplay clips and inventive fan concepts, our Pilots continue to push the limits of imagination.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This month, we&rsquo;re shining a spotlight on your work, your events, and your moments that stood out the most. Let&rsquo;s take a look!</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Community Event Winners &mdash; Discord Emoji &amp; Sticker Contest</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>We asked you to share your creativity and suggest new emojis and stickers you&rsquo;d like to see added to our Discord server&mdash;and you absolutely delivered!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>From expressive robot-inspired reactions to fun community inside jokes, your submissions brought tons of personality and charm. We received a huge variety of creative designs, and it was incredibly difficult to choose the winners.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you haven&rsquo;t yet, make sure to join our Discord and <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/941368722860417105/1493531447905222697\">check out all the submissions in the event channel</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Congratulations to our winners!&nbsp;Their submissions will soon be added to our Discord server as emojis and stickers.</p>\r\n<spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>fishstickers</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/1.webp\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/2.webp\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/3.webp\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/4.webp\" />&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/5.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Awesome_Soul</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Volta_Wizard_Sticker.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>xBennyx95</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/got_ioned.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Green Man</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Alpha.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>VI pyramid</strong>​​​​​</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/but_why.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Misty</strong>​</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Absolute_alpha.gif\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ZEALT</strong>​​​​​​</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/hamster_pilot.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>champsjay</strong>​​​</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/incoming_missile.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Golden Fireball</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/RexCole.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>A One Fish Army ツ</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Grim.gif\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you to everyone who participated&mdash;your creativity helps shape the identity of our community!</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Join the Community Events on Discord</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Looking to squad up, sharpen your strategies, or just have fun with fellow Pilots? Our community events are a great way for both newcomers and veterans to jump into teamplay, share builds, discuss tactics, and connect with the War Robots: Frontiers community on <a href=\"https://wrfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Friday Play Sessions</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Join us every Friday at 19:00 CEST for <a href=\"https://discord.com/events/941368722860417105/1398276031735136347\">Community Play Sessions</a>, hosted by <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/divinitydozer\">DivinityDozer</a>. With open lobbies and casual matches, it&rsquo;s the perfect opportunity to team up, exchange strategies, test builds, and enjoy the battlefield together.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Saturday Night Fights</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Hosted by <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itzgladzilla\">ItzGladzilla</a>&nbsp;and <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/nukerthegreat\">NukerTheGreat</a>, <a href=\"https://discord.com/events/941368722860417105/1443586740995625132\">Saturday Night Fights</a> features weekly battles&mdash;from one-on-one duels to full 6v6 draft matches. It&rsquo;s a place to test your skills, enjoy competitive teamplay, and see how far you can go.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Weekend Warfare</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Weekend Warfare is our community-driven 6v6 scrim series, starting on May 8, open to both solo Pilots and full squads. Join the action for tactical team battles, coordinated squad play, and a chance to put your strategies to the test throughout the weekend. Be sure to pre-register on our <a href=\"http://wrfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> to participate!</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Community Content</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Pilots are second to none when it comes to creativity, so we&rsquo;re putting the spotlight on some of the best from April!</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>LEGO Cyclops &amp; Purifier by Zaito</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Lego.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Hitcher Concept (WIP) by Green Man</h3>\r\n<news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Hitcher_3.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Hitcher_2.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Hitcher_1.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<h3>Paper-made Decker and Crix by Websterboi</h3>\r\n<news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Crix_1.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Decker_1.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<h3>Fan-made Concept of a War Robot by ION</h3>\r\n<news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Velos_webp.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/Velos_2.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<h3>War Robots: Frontiers Story by&nbsp;Egghead</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>A community lore story by Egghead adds new depth to the War Robots: Frontiers universe. If you enjoy fan fiction and world-building, this is a must-read thread that showcases the imagination and storytelling talent of one of our community members.</p>\r\n<spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Prologue</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\"><news-gallery>\r\n<div class=\"news-gallery__inner\">\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_1_webp.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_2.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_3.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_4.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_5.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_6.webp\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2026/05/327/prologue_7.webp\" /></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</news-gallery>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Click on the image to view it at full size, or <a href=\"https://discord.com/channels/941368722860417105/1486313623877058621\">read the full story</a> on our Discord.</em></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem>\r\n\r\n<h3>Videos to Check Out</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Our Content Creators continue to bring War Robots: Frontiers to life with gameplay breakdowns, build guides, strategy deep-dives, and entertaining battle moments. Whether you&rsquo;re looking to improve your loadouts, explore newly released content, or simply enjoy some action-packed gameplay, there&rsquo;s always something worth watching.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Here are some of this month&rsquo;s highlights from the community:</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>NEW Garuda Robot Is Here | &ldquo;Snake Catcher&rdquo; Energy Ability&nbsp;by Predator MECH</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6nZ3QsPgURQ\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/6nZ3QsPgURQ?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=7k43O\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h3>War Robots: Frontiers &mdash; New I.O.N Weapon Build! Is ION Good?&nbsp;by HectorGamingYT</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4qE-6OWf314\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/4qE-6OWf314?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=OPg2J\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h3>Norna Gameplay | War Robots: Frontiers&nbsp;by [T.C.] ĐɆ₴₮Ɽ&Oslash;ɎɆɌ</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a9yl03Cc3Wg&amp;feature=youtu.be\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/a9yl03Cc3Wg?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=L4EGT\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<h3>Chill Tryhard Match | War Robots: Frontiers&nbsp;by Leraser</h3>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-youtube\" data-align=\"center\" data-oembed=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KuwZbtxHFQ4\" data-oembed_provider=\"youtube\" data-resizetype=\"noresize\" style=\"text-align:center\"><iframe allowfullscreen=\"true\" allowscriptaccess=\"always\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/KuwZbtxHFQ4?wmode=transparent&amp;jqoemcache=AUWn8\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"embeddedContent oembed-provider-\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n\r\n<p>A huge thank you to all creators who continue to support the War Robots: Frontiers community by producing guides, gameplay showcases, reviews, and entertaining content. Your passion helps keep the Frontiers community informed, inspired, and growing.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you&rsquo;re looking for more War Robots: Frontiers content, make sure to follow and subscribe to our amazing community creators on Twitch and YouTube!</p>\r\n<spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Twitch Streamers:</strong>​​​</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/nukerthegreat\">NukerTheGreat</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/shockradio\">ShockRadio</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/commanderbriggs\">CommanderBriggs</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/divinitydozer\">DivinityDozer</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/eddy_gp22\">eddy_gp22</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/fr8trainshane\">Fr8TrainShane</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/gokuwarrobots\">gokuwarrobots</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/ha_le_k_te_raz\">ha_le_k_te_raz</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itzgladzilla\">ItzGladzilla</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/itzwhitetc\">iTzWhiteTc</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/megapunk83\">megapunk83</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mexicanmix214\">mexicanmix214</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/mikenasty135\">mikenasty135</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/rawaweo9\">RawAweO9</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/warhammer40kgamer\">warhammer40kgamer</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/bigsweets_117\">bigsweets_117</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/x_xxjusticexx_x\">x_xxjusticexx_x</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/zoegamer3o5\">zoegamer3o5</a>,&nbsp;and more!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem><spoileritem class=\"spoiler\"><spoileritemheader>\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__header\">\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>YouTube Channels:</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritemheader>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"spoiler__text\">\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@predatormech\">PREDATOR MECH</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCICn7D-OQUTUT9iLa8y4Uqw\">Shock Radio Gaming</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwN8I_M2ASVbNjqe1aAYuPA\">HectorGamingYT</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI4tIlq-uEGC97dP10iWSPQ\">LARS | War Robots Frontiers</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLA6hrUEhsaE77De1uz4viw\">FEDE EN DIRECTO WR:F</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_hw_iFTYJfkfqtEJysxNBA\">LERASER</a>, and more!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</spoileritem>\r\n\r\n<p>We&rsquo;re always excited to see new creators joining the scene. If you&rsquo;re interested in streaming or creating content, consider joining our <a href=\"https://creators.my.games/pages/warrobotsfrontiers\">Content Creators Program</a>!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you to everyone who contributed this month&mdash;whether through art, gameplay clips, videos, or events. The War Robots: Frontiers community continues to grow because of your creativity and passion.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong> </strong><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong> </strong><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official&nbsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>,<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\"> Facebook</a>,<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\"> Instagram</a>,<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\"> YouTube</a>, and join the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
